WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.570 --> 00:00:03.090
Okay, let me take a break from the serious
stuff.

00:00:03.090 --> 00:00:06.630
But this is so funny and we need a little
bit of levity these days.

00:00:06.630 --> 00:00:08.900
So maybe you'll grant me a couple of minutes
for this.

00:00:08.900 --> 00:00:13.269
Every once in a while I'll do something random
on the show just to make things up, mix things

00:00:13.269 --> 00:00:15.430
up for myself, mix things up for people.

00:00:15.430 --> 00:00:20.160
Uh, do a little something different with the
staff just to, to, uh, as a joke.

00:00:20.160 --> 00:00:24.180
Once at our New York city studio, the heat
wasn't working in the entire building, so

00:00:24.180 --> 00:00:26.970
I wore like a big winter coat and a hat during
the show.

00:00:26.970 --> 00:00:30.039
And I don't think I ever really explained
what I was doing or why I did that.

00:00:30.039 --> 00:00:32.140
And I've got a whole bunch of emails about
it once.

00:00:32.140 --> 00:00:37.760
A couple of years ago I did an entire show
with my hair looking really odd to celebrate

00:00:37.760 --> 00:00:43.500
that we reached 2000 patrons on our Patrion
page and it created quite a stir earlier this

00:00:43.500 --> 00:00:44.500
week.

00:00:44.500 --> 00:00:48.500
I did the show with my hair looking odd and
there really wasn't any reason for it other

00:00:48.500 --> 00:00:50.989
than I just felt like mixing things up.

00:00:50.989 --> 00:00:55.470
Our audience was so concerned about it that
I want to show you some of the hilarious messages

00:00:55.470 --> 00:01:00.390
I received and I love this because a lot of
people were seem genuinely worried about me

00:01:00.390 --> 00:01:04.740
that my disheveled hair was assigned, that
the Iran thing was really getting me down

00:01:04.740 --> 00:01:06.010
or something like that.

00:01:06.010 --> 00:01:09.799
Sometimes I just do things for a reaction
because I'm curious if something like this

00:01:09.799 --> 00:01:13.280
will take over the comment sections and typically
it does.

00:01:13.280 --> 00:01:17.830
Once during a live stream I did on YouTube
I wore a sweatshirt that had a weird shawl

00:01:17.830 --> 00:01:23.299
color that almost looked like a bathrobe and
like 90% of the comments on the live stream

00:01:23.299 --> 00:01:25.229
or about my shawl color.

00:01:25.229 --> 00:01:30.420
So check out some of the comments, um, that
I uh, that I got about the hair stuff.

00:01:30.420 --> 00:01:31.939
Warren has a plan for everything.

00:01:31.939 --> 00:01:34.780
I wonder if she has a plan for David's hair.

00:01:34.780 --> 00:01:39.369
100% of David's haircuts are being paid for
by no one.

00:01:39.369 --> 00:01:40.369
Are you?

00:01:40.369 --> 00:01:41.369
Okay.

00:01:41.369 --> 00:01:44.520
David unshaven disheveled hair looking matter
and matter.

00:01:44.520 --> 00:01:47.000
And this is from a guy who used to have long,
long hair.

00:01:47.000 --> 00:01:48.170
You're not looking well mate.

00:01:48.170 --> 00:01:49.170
Hope all is well.

00:01:49.170 --> 00:01:50.170
Have you thought about a break?

00:01:50.170 --> 00:01:51.170
I actually just took a break.

00:01:51.170 --> 00:01:52.170
I'm feeling quite good.

00:01:52.170 --> 00:01:53.170
Seriously.

00:01:53.170 --> 00:01:54.219
Do something with the hair.

00:01:54.219 --> 00:02:02.250
At least the fork in a light socket look is
an improvement over the usual Gumby, Gumby

00:02:02.250 --> 00:02:03.250
slant.

00:02:03.250 --> 00:02:06.219
Sorry to be off topic, but your hair has a
life of its own at the moment.

00:02:06.219 --> 00:02:08.009
Soon it'll have its own zip code.

00:02:08.009 --> 00:02:10.270
No doubt you're making a lot of balding men.

00:02:10.270 --> 00:02:11.270
Very jealous.

00:02:11.270 --> 00:02:12.270
Maybe the funniest.

00:02:12.270 --> 00:02:14.980
This is from a very nice lady who watches
the show with her husband.

00:02:14.980 --> 00:02:16.520
I posted this to my social media.

00:02:16.520 --> 00:02:18.060
This is my favorite.

00:02:18.060 --> 00:02:19.060
Hi David.

00:02:19.060 --> 00:02:20.330
Lots to worry over.

00:02:20.330 --> 00:02:25.710
But Terry and I are hoping you're okay as
your hair is more disheveled each passing

00:02:25.710 --> 00:02:28.010
day, so we wish you well.

00:02:28.010 --> 00:02:30.030
Thank you for your opinions.

00:02:30.030 --> 00:02:31.910
Warm regards from down under.

00:02:31.910 --> 00:02:32.910
I'm fine.

00:02:32.910 --> 00:02:34.980
I appreciate the concern.

00:02:34.980 --> 00:02:36.020
It's just a joke.

00:02:36.020 --> 00:02:38.190
Sometimes we do things to mix things up.

00:02:38.190 --> 00:02:41.920
Producer Pat was perplexed by my hair a couple
of days ago.

00:02:41.920 --> 00:02:49.340
I actually, uh, I've run the idea by Pat of
one day just wearing a fake mustache, but

00:02:49.340 --> 00:02:50.560
never mentioning it.

00:02:50.560 --> 00:02:55.460
Like never addressing it, never explaining
how it appeared one day and was gone the next.

00:02:55.460 --> 00:02:59.580
But now that I see how many people were worried
about just my hair, hundreds and hundreds

00:02:59.580 --> 00:03:02.700
of comments about it, I should probably think
twice about it.

00:03:02.700 --> 00:03:05.091
Let me know if you were worried about me on
Twitter at [inaudible],

00:03:05.091 --> 00:03:06.091
the Pacman.

00:03:06.091 --> 00:03:07.091
Follow me there.

00:03:07.091 --> 00:03:08.091
We will take a quick break.

00:03:08.091 --> 00:03:10.990
Huge, huge Friday show for you today.

00:03:10.990 --> 00:03:11.349
I'm glad you're with us.

